================================================================
GAME DATA
================================================================

The raw game exports (`data/`) and the class dump (`sdk/raw/`) are
generated locally from an owned copy of the game and are not
distributed in this repository. Game names, values and asset names
quoted in the documentation belong to Bulkhead Ltd and Team17 and are
quoted for reference and commentary.

If you represent Bulkhead or Team17 and want something removed,
please open an issue or contact the repository author directly.

